# Raw sample streams are large (~240 KB per rung-4 cell) and are reproducible
# by re-running the ladder; the REDUCED evidence -- cell.json (measurement +
# every check with its measured/expected/tolerance/margin), ladder.json (the
# campaign) and selftest.json -- is what a reader needs and is committed.
samples.json
samples.json.trace
samples.json.error
console.log
engine.log
engine.log.newton.json
newton_solver.log
_run_webots.sh
# Rung 18 records one replayed trajectory per toss, 50 per cell.  Same rule:
# the reduction is in cell.json / measurement.json and the raw stream is
# reproducible from the vendored recording.
*.npz
*.npz.phase.txt
*.npz.traceback.txt
unused_samples.json
# Rung 9's replica documents: 26 bodies x 3 coords x 400 samples, written as
# exact float64 repr because the rung's whole claim is bitwise identity.  Same
# rule as samples.json -- raw stream out, reduction in.
run_a.json
run_b.json
run_c.json
